[API Documentation]
Returns a tensor holding Sobel edge maps.

  Example usage:

  For general usage, `image` would be loaded from a file as below:

  ```python
  image_bytes = tf.io.read_file(path_to_image_file)
  image = tf.image.decode_image(image_bytes)
